From 1c876b2a5bbae2a0af1598fcaa0ba5bec41571ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominggoes Isakh <drjisakh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:13:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] camera2: legacy: Implement the new ICameraDeviceUser methods

- configureStreams(): with configure_streams_batch enabled (read only on
  this release), CameraDeviceImpl configures sessions through this single
  call. Run the same begin/delete/create/end sequence as the unbatched
  path, and don't leave a failed configuration in progress.
- updateOutputConfigurations(): not supported, like
  updateOutputConfiguration().
- package.html: use a plain @hide; metalava rejects {@hide} in package
  docs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I9163b593b900b64e7ffefa9fbdda17b2ed6b23a3
---
 .../camera2/legacy/CameraDeviceUserShim.java  | 53 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../hardware/camera2/legacy/package.html      |  4 +-
 2 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/java/android/hardware/camera2/legacy/CameraDeviceUserShim.java b/core/java/android/hardware/camera2/legacy/CameraDeviceUserShim.java
